Z||000001||StuGood||01-06-2001||12:43 PM||||I believe I got my from a Harbor Fright  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> store.  I bet NAPA would have it, too.  Call around and ask before you go to pick it up.<P>Before that, I used a big washer, 2 sockets to transfer load to the spring plate, and the steering wheel nut.  Something like that, anyway.  But it's easier to use the proper tool.    ||||reg||1
